  m_text: "Move your        through a tree maze and push         to        to score.
    Once goal count drops to 0, you Win!  and can go to struggle to the next level.\n\nBeware
    of putting       close to walls  or corners, cause it is hard to get them out
    of there. \n\nIf you stuck you can undo your moves until last scored goal. You
    can always restart the level if you think that squirrels wont survive the winter
    by starving or any other excuse! \n\nAs the levels continues new nuts, goals
    and obstacles will get in your way! For more detailes about all interactions
    check the pages bellow!\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d955eb3858845cd4fb30f4b7f4d2e83d, type: 2}
